{"text": "\u00a9\n\nUniversity Circle Inc. and the University Circle Police Department comply with the\nrequirements of our Memorandum of Understanding with the City of\nCleveland. These include use of force and pursuit policies, as well as training for all\nofficers and dispatchers. Implementation of our new Citizen Review Board has\nproceeded steadily despite pandemic-related delays. UCI has identified, engaged,\nand recruited CRB members who represent the University Circle community,\ndeveloped written policies, employed an independent investigator to receive and\nprocess any complaints, and inaugurated the use of body cameras by UCPD\nOfficers. The introductory meeting of the CRB was held on September 29,\n2021. Training is scheduled for May 6, 2022. The UCPD is committed to being a\npositive, accountable presence in the community.\n\nUNIVERSITY CIRCLE 'N\u00b0\n\nDevelopment Service Advocacy 10831 Magnolia Drive Cleveland, OH 44106-1887\nP 216.791.3900 F 216.791-3935 www.universitycircle.org",
